title: "Project Helghast"
type: software
version: 0.1.2
authors:
  - alias: undecuple
repository-code: "https://github.com/undecuple/project-helghast"
url: "https://github.com/undecuple/project-helghast"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Killzone 3 // Unofficial PC Port (static recompilation). A native PC port of Killzone 3 (PS3) by static recompilation of its PPU and SPU code on ps3recomp, with the PS3
  system software it calls reimplemented and graphics on Direct3D 12. Contains no game code or data.
keywords:
  - static recompilation
  - PS3
  - ps3recomp
  - Killzone 3
  - game preservation
